    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Living Rampart.</strong> You have trained in the <em>Athletics</em> skill. As a reaction when a creature you can see targets an ally adjacent to you with an attack, you can interpose bulk and bad life choices, imposing 3d10 keep lowest 2 on that attack roll. Once you use this feature, you can’t use it again until you finish a Soma Break.</p>",
